      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;about-me&#34;&gt;About Me&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I am Andrew Jesus, a passionate photographer and aspiring programmer. This website showcases my work and the journey I am on in both photography and technology.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;my-journey&#34;&gt;My Journey&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Photography has always been a part of my life. I picked up my first camera during my early teens, and ever since, I have been captivated by the art of capturing moments.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Programming has allowed me to bring my creative ideas to life through technology. I enjoy building applications that can enhance the user experience and share my passion for photography.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
